From: libva-v4l2 AV1 qualification work
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] av1_vaapi: opt-in CBS full-frame slice transport

Experimental paired producer only; no AV1 support advertisement. Enable with
V4L2_VA_AV1_CBS_TRANSPORT=1 only with a validated matching driver. Original parsed
headers stay immutable. Only complete FRAME OBUs/one tile group supported.
No reserved VA ABI fields used. Standard slice data includes exact serialized
headers and tile bytes; offsets still address only each tile payload.

